"You have %d gold pieces in the bank.\n"
"You have %d gold pieces.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Tens %d moedas de ouro no banco.\n"
"Levas contigo %d moedas de ouro.\n"
"\n"

#: src/buildings.c:135
msgid "Your wish? "
msgstr "O teu desejo? "

